OL,3,GNEWSADriver and passenger die after car
OL,4,Ahits wall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver and their passenger died
OL,7,Fmoments after the car they were in
OL,8,Fstruck a wall, police have said.
OL,10,FIt happened in Copperfield Road,
OL,11,FChelmsford, at about 01:45 GMT on
OL,12,FSunday.
OL,14,FEssex Police said a property's wall was
OL,15,Fdamaged when it was struck by the Ford
OL,16,FFiesta, close to the junction with
OL,17,FHavisham Way.
OL,19,FThe road was shut in the aftermath of
OL,20,Fthe incident and officers have appealed
OL,21,Ffor any witnesses to contact them.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
